      "note": "dev/test only, compiled in only with the kakure_pool `dev-verify` cargo feature (never in a release build); appended at the end of the enum so the wire tag of every other instruction is stable regardless of the feature. CPIs directly into pool.verifiers[circuit_id] with no nullifier/root/leaf checks or side effects -- lets a test run a real verifier binary without needing the pool's on-chain state to match that proof's fixture root/leaves.",
